ffices & Departments Office of the President Cabinet Board of Trustees Campus Map Parents News Events Campus Store Give MyW&J Campus Map Offices & Departments Emergency Contact Careers Privacy Policy Title IX Site Map Facebook Twitter Instagram 888-W-AND-JAY Contact WJ 60 S Lincoln St.,\nWashington, PA 15301 Search Careers Plan a Visit (opens in new tab) Request Information (opens in new tab) Apply Now Home / Careers Share on Facebook 𝕏 Share on X Share on Linkedin Share on WhatsApp Share on Email Share on Print Thank you for your interest in Washington & Jefferson College. All applications submitted through our online process will receive an automatic confirmation email. Due to the number of applications received, we regret that we are unable to respond to status inquiries regarding whether a position has been filled or send position closing notifications to all applicants. If we determine that your skills and experience match the position requirements, we will contact you to discuss the opportunity further. Search for a job: State Pennsylvania Search Jobs Browse through all jobs (14) Administrative Assistant Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Assistant Women's Lacrosse Coach Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Benefits and Data Specialist Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Campus Police Sergeant Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Chief of Staff - Office of the CFO Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Coordinator for Employer Engagement/Career Advisor Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Custodian 8am to 4pm Off Mondays and Tuesdays Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Major Gifts Officer Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Operations & Member Experience Coordinator Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Part Time Campus Shuttle Driver Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Public Safety Specialist Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Residence Life Coordinator for Student Staff Recruitment & Development Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Tenure Track - Assistant or Associate Professor of Psychology Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Wellbeing Counselor and Coordinator Washington, Pennsylvania, United States - 15301 Employee Benefits Washington & Jefferson College offers a comprehensive benefit package for benefit eligible employees; including health, vision, and dental coverage, group life insurance, AD&D and LTD coverage, retirement plan, generous leave time, and the tuition benefit programs. These benefits add significantly to the employee’s total compensation package. Equal Opportunity Employer Washington & Jefferson College (W&J) complies with all applicable federal, state and local laws and provides equal opportunity in all educational programs and activities, admission of students and conditions of employment for all qualified individuals regardless of race, color, sex, religion, age, disability, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, gender identity, or national origin. Title IX For more information about Title IX compliance, please visit Title IX at W&J . W&J is committed to assisting all members of the W&J community in providing for their own safety and security. Annual Security Report Committed to open and transparent communication, the Office of Campus & Public Safety publishes the Annual Security Report (also known as the Clery Report) with statistics for the last three years. The Annual Security Report can be found here: Annual Security Report Links Human Resources Future Students Academics Student Life Athletics Alumni Virtual Tour About W&J Parents News Events Give Campus Store Campus Map Offices & Departments Emergency Contact Careers Privacy Policy Title IX Site Map Get in Touch 888-W-AND-JAY Contact W&J 60 S Lincoln St., Washington, PA 15301 © 2026 Washington & Jefferson College. All Rights Reserved. Subscribe to news . Unsubscribe ."
